## How it compares

| | Andromity | Aider | Cursor | Claude Code |
|--|-----------|-------|--------|-------------|
| Folder trust model | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Permission levels (SAFE → YOLO) | ✅ | ❌ | Partial | ❌ |
| Built-in cron scheduler | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| Inline diff viewer | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| Session management + `/undo` | ✅ | ❌ | Partial | ❌ |
| Agent profiles | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | Partial |
| Local-first / Ollama / BYOK | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| MCP support | ✅ | ❌ | Partial | ✅ |
| TUI workspace | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |

